{
  "_comment": [
    "SeAuditPrivilege for cryptod, and for nothing else.",
    "",
    "cryptod writes KMES events for every process that uses libpcrypto:",
    "cryptod.algorithm.warned and cryptod.exception.used, which most",
    "processes can't write for themselves because they lack the privilege,",
    "and cryptod.policy.applied and cryptod.policy.failed (cryptod.evman).",
    "It lets the holder write events under its own kernel-stamped identity,",
    "nothing more. cryptod deliberately lacks SeTcbPrivilege, so KMES limits",
    "its rate as any process's; it queues records below that limit.",
    "",
    "SeChangeNotifyPrivilege beside it, because peinit removes every",
    "privilege outside RequiredPrivileges and a process without it can't",
    "traverse a directory to reach a file.",
    "",
    "authd unions the privileges of every SID on a token, and a service",
    "token carries the S-1-5-80 service SID derived from the service name,",
    "so a record named for that SID grants the privileges to this one",
    "service.",
    "",
    "The SID below is SHA-1 of 'CRYPTOD' as upper-cased UTF-16LE, read as",
    "five little-endian u32s, the derivation authd and peinit implement.",
    "libpcrypto trusts a policy copy only if this SID or SYSTEM owns it",
    "(runtime/machine.c), so renaming the service needs both changed.",
    "",
    "Separate from cryptod-service.reg, as timed's is: a privilege grant is",
    "a different kind of statement from a service definition, and an image",
    "may want to review it apart.",
    "",
    "Shipped into /usr/share/regim/; inert until an image names it in",
    "[registry] autoapply."
  ],
  "keys": [
    { "path": "Machine\\Generic" },
    { "path": "Machine\\Generic\\Authn" },
    { "path": "Machine\\Generic\\Authn\\Policy" },
    {
      "path": "Machine\\Generic\\Authn\\Policy\\S-1-5-80-2691053820-547492864-353945177-641201782-1210658655",
      "values": [
        {
          "name": "Privileges",
          "type": "multi",
          "data": ["SeChangeNotifyPrivilege", "SeAuditPrivilege"]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
